  "description": "For the lowly maid Lucien, life was a daily battle just to survive. But everything changes when she meets a mysterious man in the confessional. Behind the indifferent face of a holy priest lie cold, elegant green eyes—and a dangerous man who wears a different identity every time they meet. \n\nAs Lucien finds herself falling deeper into his web, she experiences a forbidden desire for the very first time: *she actually wants to live.* \n\nAnd as their worlds collide, that spark ignites into an uncontrollable, consuming flame called **LOVE**.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856184)",
